@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title SQ — mixed workload and observed host limits
left to right direction
rectangle "Observed demo allocation\n2 vCPU / 4 GB RAM / 40 GB disk\nHistorical observation, not capacity proof" as Host
rectangle "Competing logical workload\nPrivate/employer paths + files/media + real Git\nConditional processing / maintenance / recovery" as Mix
rectangle "Defined current workload + limits + actual later measures\nAdmission / degradation / errors / retained/temp growth" as Evidence
Host --> Evidence : actual evaluated configuration required
Mix --> Evidence : users are not concurrency
note bottom of Host
Nginx / MySQL / PHP-FPM and Laravel demo were observed.
Idle free memory/disk does not prove combined usable capacity.
end note
note bottom of Mix
Conditional jobs still need independent enabling/isolation evidence.
This model does not choose co-hosting or new purchases.
end note

legend bottom
Logical analysis / evidence boundaries, not installed controls or selected architecture.
No security, load, provider, backup, restore or live-change operation performed.
endlegend
@enduml
